ure e-signatures and 100% client-side privacy.\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"esignatures for insurance,sign insurance policy pdf,insurance claim esignature,eIDAS insurance sign\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://fitmyform.com/esignatures-for-insurance\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"FitMyForm - Student Document Resizer &amp; Formatter\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Format passport photos &amp; signatures to exact pixel dimensions &amp; KB limits for SSC, UPSC, Banking, &amp; State online forms. 100% Client-Side Privacy.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://fitmyform.com\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"FitMyForm\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"FitMyForm - Student Document Resizer for Online Forms\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Resize photos &amp; signatures for SSC, UPSC, Banking &amp; College forms with 100% browser privacy.\"/><link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.2vob68tjqpejf.ico\" sizes=\"256x256\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-full flex flex-col bg-[#080b11] text-slate-100 font-sans selection:bg-indigo-600 selection:text-white\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#080b11] text-slate-100 flex flex-col selection:bg-indigo-600 selection:text-white\"><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 w-full bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-800/80 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between gap-6\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0 group\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-l